                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e861dafc-7d64-3716-aaba-203c17233831",
                                        "entry_id": "43d24362-82d9-3ff3-b2d6-b4803edd87e9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Precisely agreeing with a standard, a fact, or the truth; perfectly conforming; neither exceeding nor falling short in any respect."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "331cd5bb-8f5d-4abf-b4e9-99127a8d423e",
                                                "sense_id": "e861dafc-7d64-3716-aaba-203c17233831",
                                                "text": "The clock keeps exact time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f8555c1-5b67-439e-88f8-60cb9228aaee",
                                                "sense_id": "e861dafc-7d64-3716-aaba-203c17233831",
                                                "text": "He paid the exact debt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c3e7617-93c0-4ad6-b81f-f9b16d00c7e2",
                                                "sense_id": "e861dafc-7d64-3716-aaba-203c17233831",
                                                "text": "an exact copy of a letter"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5dc87c1b-9a74-4b59-98a3-53ef0ee24817",
                                                "sense_id": "e861dafc-7d64-3716-aaba-203c17233831",
                                                "text": "exact accounts"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "78deed34-d7e6-33ce-85be-0379eefb39c4",
                                        "entry_id": "43d24362-82d9-3ff3-b2d6-b4803edd87e9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Habitually careful to agree with a standard, a rule, or a promise; accurate; methodical; punctual."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "435ecdc5-c2de-4d5f-9d5a-9b29e5db21f3",
                                                "sense_id": "78deed34-d7e6-33ce-85be-0379eefb39c4",
                                                "text": "a man exact in observing an appointment"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa9cd106-f68b-4ac5-8dbd-cb665bf32fc3",
                                                "sense_id": "78deed34-d7e6-33ce-85be-0379eefb39c4",
                                                "text": "In my doings I was exact."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2da0c669-5b92-4bf2-af5c-93ec4fe783e0",
                                                "sense_id": "78deed34-d7e6-33ce-85be-0379eefb39c4",
                                                "text": "I see thou art exact of taste."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "439d5b81-473a-4f0c-8a25-a895d442ef14",
                                                "sense_id": "78deed34-d7e6-33ce-85be-0379eefb39c4",
                                                "text": "During the whole time of his abode in the university he generally spent thirteen hours of the day in study; by which assiduity besides an exact dispatch of the whole course of philosophy, he read over in a manner all classic authors that are extant[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e824449b-f9ff-381a-9370-e515ab2cbff4",
                                        "entry_id": "43d24362-82d9-3ff3-b2d6-b4803edd87e9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Precisely or definitely conceived or stated; strict."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e736da45-e075-469c-b925-d1e673f4d69b",
                                                "sense_id": "e824449b-f9ff-381a-9370-e515ab2cbff4",
                                                "text": "An exact command,\n Larded with many several sorts of reason."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "42f88589-059f-35d0-84e9-b9ec91edc6a7",
                                        "entry_id": "43d24362-82d9-3ff3-b2d6-b4803edd87e9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Such that the kernel of each morphism is the image of the preceding one."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "64dcd403-f4dd-3875-836a-1a0fe585fbde",
                                        "entry_id": "43d24362-82d9-3ff3-b2d6-b4803edd87e9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Such that it preserves short exact sequences."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "exact",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7de779f4-4be8-3751-bc0c-371ea8d14502",
                                        "entry_id": "d29bdc81-c491-3c0c-bab0-8b5d9a8f2e1f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To demand and enforce the payment or performance of, sometimes in a forcible or imperious way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ambitransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82315863-af5d-4407-b1fd-e174820e7112",
                                                "sense_id": "7de779f4-4be8-3751-bc0c-371ea8d14502",
                                                "text": "to exact tribute, fees, or obedience from someone"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7daa07a-3984-4176-946b-0b1b9549c82b",
                                                "sense_id": "7de779f4-4be8-3751-bc0c-371ea8d14502",
                                                "text": "He said into them, Exact no more than that which is appointed you."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "624c641b-c1ce-4ef2-b456-276cefa6ccbd",
                                                "sense_id": "7de779f4-4be8-3751-bc0c-371ea8d14502",
                                                "text": "Their goal is retributive: to exact a price from Palestinian civilians (and in some cases left-wing Israeli Jews, Christians, and Israeli security forces) for actions Israeli authorities take against the settlers, usually building enforcement in illegally built settlements."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7699f265-22cb-495d-82f2-2a0042bb5724",
                                                "sense_id": "7de779f4-4be8-3751-bc0c-371ea8d14502",
                                                "text": "She was a superb judge who gave her best and exacted the best from each of us, whether in agreement or disagreement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1d42396-ad8e-4dc5-8742-68eca78c5180",
                                                "sense_id": "7de779f4-4be8-3751-bc0c-371ea8d14502",
                                                "text": "[…] a generic, strikingly universal, deity, “ha-elohim,” who tests, who exacts and extracts, and who is the object of fear […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "058c9fd3-f36e-3b67-934e-09b980ad2bbf",
                                        "entry_id": "d29bdc81-c491-3c0c-bab0-8b5d9a8f2e1f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make desirable or necessary."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c72e501-4cab-49ff-ae07-8cba6da35727",
                                                "sense_id": "058c9fd3-f36e-3b67-934e-09b980ad2bbf",
                                                "text": "I vvait, Madam, / To knovv vvhat your commands are; my deſignes / Exact me in another place."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "79c62de9-740e-313d-856f-498bb4ce5443",
                                        "entry_id": "d29bdc81-c491-3c0c-bab0-8b5d9a8f2e1f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To inflict; to forcibly obtain or produce; to visit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ca5a677-43af-4633-a893-21fc6ab55f08",
                                                "sense_id": "79c62de9-740e-313d-856f-498bb4ce5443",
                                                "text": "to exact revenge on someone"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
